    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divinate Waifu Racing is the midcore fantasy action RPG with elements of combat racing and gacha, has a non-linear story, where magically enhanced characters (the Sephiroths) run at speeds from 50 to 300 km/h, pick up and use weapons and abilities, knock down the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strength of the characters is determined by horsepower, instead of the standard RPG-based strength, dexterity or intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In-battle controls are non-standard, just like in racing games - throttle, brake, drift, acceleration.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terra Phantasma Base Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's base is the hyperspace village named Terra Phantasma, where crafting, character training, mission planning, and storyline with romance progression take place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized islands and your account-wide passive skill tree let players craft their perfect economic strategy to dominate Elvynn's player-driven marketplace!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team of 4 characters, with real-time switching available in certain game modes - adapt your tactics on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade characters and items with other players, creating endless possibilities for a thriving player-driven economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We fully support the DWR community's creativity through Steam Workshop and can't wait to showcase player creations in-game!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elvynn Worldmap exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map serves as your strategic hub - move step-by-step between weekly events including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Epic boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Competitive tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hidden treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Wandering merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Special random events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The endgame system lets you ramp up difficulty for greater challenges and better rewards from battles and bosses!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Incidents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 14 distinct Incident types - whether you want pure racing, tactical sabotage, or brutal boss encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each Incident has strict entry requirements (like 300-350 horsepower limits or FWD only) to guarantee fair races where skill decides the winner!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key narrative genres: <strong>Adventure, Drama, and Romance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters are a group of outcasts called &quot;Swagmen&quot; who are trying to find a way to control the mysterious superpower Theokinesis and take one of the sides in a magical war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Theokinesis allows its users to convert kinetic force into magical energy, granting unparalleled power that terrifies mages and politicians across the Elvynn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted yet determined, the <i>Swagmen\u00a0</i>fight against the entire world to uncover the truth about Teokinesis, each other\u2019s pasts, and the love that could either save Elvynn - or reduce it to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every quest features at least two endings, and every boss can be defeated in multiple ways. The story campaign offers a minimum of three distinct conclusions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes Divinate Waifu Racing special:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of arcade racing, ARPG and Turn-Based Strategy genres;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dramatic storyline based on the tabletop RPG universe Divinate (since 2002);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic races, arenas and boss fights;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable passive skill tree for player's account;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gacha mechanics with new items and characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to bargain for better prices with NPCs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A developing in-game market between players;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore endgame content;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Date-sim;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable random events on the world map, affecting both the gameplay and the story;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for gamepad and even racing wheel;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strict but stylish design;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular nowadays anime style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers closely interact with the DWR community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential for eSports.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divinate Waifu Racing is the midcore fantasy action RPG with elements of combat racing and gacha, has a non-linear story, where magically enhanced characters (the Sephiroths) run at speeds from 50 to 300 km/h, pick up and use weapons and abilities, knock down the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/b61ae8107f98c8c966e3358c06dc053e.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strength of the characters is determined by horsepower, instead of the standard RPG-based strength, dexterity or intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In-battle controls are non-standard, just like in racing games - throttle, brake, drift, acceleration.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terra Phantasma Base Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's base is the hyperspace village named Terra Phantasma, where crafting, character training, mission planning, and storyline with romance progression take place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/17f769d88b9e4147be89081298cca909.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized islands and your account-wide passive skill tree let players craft their perfect economic strategy to dominate Elvynn's player-driven marketplace!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team of 4 characters, with real-time switching available in certain game modes - adapt your tactics on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/89ed87f483291f210258b2f1a25fc852.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade characters and items with other players, creating endless possibilities for a thriving player-driven economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We fully support the DWR community's creativity through Steam Workshop and can't wait to showcase player creations in-game!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elvynn Worldmap exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map serves as your strategic hub - move step-by-step between weekly events including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Epic boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Competitive tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hidden treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Wandering merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Special random events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/2ad3844c126f03d18eeeefd850f88e9d.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The endgame system lets you ramp up difficulty for greater challenges and better rewards from battles and bosses!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Incidents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 14 distinct Incident types - whether you want pure racing, tactical sabotage, or brutal boss encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/398b73dec84f63490683ae2a9b6e9ebf.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each Incident has strict entry requirements (like 300-350 horsepower limits or FWD only) to guarantee fair races where skill decides the winner!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key narrative genres: <strong>Adventure, Drama, and Romance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters are a group of outcasts called &quot;Swagmen&quot; who are trying to find a way to control the mysterious superpower Theokinesis and take one of the sides in a magical war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Theokinesis allows its users to convert kinetic force into magical energy, granting unparalleled power that terrifies mages and politicians across the Elvynn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted yet determined, the <i>Swagmen\u00a0</i>fight against the entire world to uncover the truth about Teokinesis, each other\u2019s pasts, and the love that could either save Elvynn - or reduce it to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every quest features at least two endings, and every boss can be defeated in multiple ways. The story campaign offers a minimum of three distinct conclusions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes Divinate Waifu Racing special:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.poster.avif?t=1748460353\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.webm?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722480/extras/a1fbb105fd3d84c17876527b804a4646.mp4?t=1748460353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of arcade racing, ARPG and Turn-Based Strategy genres;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dramatic storyline based on the tabletop RPG universe Divinate (since 2002);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic races, arenas and boss fights;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable passive skill tree for player's account;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gacha mechanics with new items and characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to bargain for better prices with NPCs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A developing in-game market between players;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore endgame content;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Date-sim;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable random events on the world map, affecting both the gameplay and the story;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for gamepad and even racing wheel;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strict but stylish design;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular nowadays anime style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers closely interact with the DWR community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential for eSports.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
